    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.webm?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.mp4?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>[Test Subject Name]</strong> is an FPS Platformer that sees you descend through layers of test chambers, fighting multitudes of robots along the way, and coming in contact with intelligent machines that want you dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.webm?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.mp4?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your robotic implants and marksmanship to combat the hordes of hostile machines, and try to figure out if the voices you keep hearing through the speakers are friends or foes, or both.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/bdc840517be6bd2dc4dd4fb3f8c30a5d.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/bdc840517be6bd2dc4dd4fb3f8c30a5d.webm?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/bdc840517be6bd2dc4dd4fb3f8c30a5d.mp4?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Keep swapping and dropping guns as they start to overheat, and decide whether to use a laser-powered sniper rifle or a radon-fueled minigun, or simply return to your trusty revolver.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.webm?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/abdcb7899a2432026aa545323c06f701.mp4?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>[Test Subject Name]</strong> is an FPS Platformer that sees you descend through layers of test chambers, fighting multitudes of robots along the way, and coming in contact with intelligent machines that want you dead.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.webm?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/f4eff286bd52a2daf1c65401a7268a96.mp4?t=1751728751\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your robotic implants and marksmanship to combat the hordes of hostile machines, and try to figure out if the voices you keep hearing through the speakers are friends or foes, or both.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2842570/extras/bdc840517be6bd2dc4dd4fb3f8c30a5d.poster.avif?t=1751728751\" width=600 height=78 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steam